Bertini input file declarations: random numbers -- an option which designates symbols/strings/variables that will be set to be a random real number or random complex number
****************************************************************************************************************************************************************************

This option should be set to a list of symbols, strings, or variables. Elements
of this list will be fixed to random real/complex numbers when Bertini is
called.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[x,y,c1,c2]                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : makeB'InputFile(storeBM2Files,                                          |
|              AffVariableGroup=>{{x,y}},                                     |
|              RandomReal=>{c1,c2},--c1=.1212, c2=.4132 may be written to the |
|              B'Polynomials=>{x-c1,y-c2});                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|input file.                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : R=QQ[x,y,c1,c2]                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : makeB'InputFile(storeBM2Files,                                          |
|              AffVariableGroup=>{{x,y}},                                     |
|              RandomComplex=>{c1,c2},--c1=.1212+ii*.1344, c2=.4132-ii*.2144  |
|              B'Polynomials=>{x-c1,y-c2});                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|are written to the input file.                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

AFTER Bertini is run, the random values are stored in a file named
"random_values".



