Description
===========

After Bertini does a run many files are created. This function imports the
coordinates of solutions from the simple "raw_solutions" file. By using the
option NameSolutionsFile=>"real_finite_solutions" we would import solutions
from real finite solutions. Other common file names are
"nonsingular_solutions", "finite_solutions", "infinite_solutions", and
"singular_solutions".

If the NameSolutionsFile option is set to 0 then "nonsingular_solutions" is
imported, is set to 1 then "real_finite_solutions" is imported, is set to 2
then "infinite_solutions" is imported, is set to 3 then "finite_solutions" is
imported, is set to 4 then "start" is imported, is set to 5 then
