makeB'Section -- makeB'Section creates a hash table that represents a hyperplane.
*********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        makeB'Section(l)
  * Inputs:
      * l, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, A list of variables.
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * B'Homogenization => ..., default value 1
      * B'NumberCoefficients => ..., default value {}
      * ContainsPoint => ..., default value {}
      * NameB'Section => ..., default value null
      * RandomCoefficientGenerator => ..., default value
        FunctionClosure[../../../../../Macaulay2/packages/Bertini.m2:2314:37-
        2314:66]

Description
===========

makeB'Section allows for easy creation of equations that define hyperplanes.
The default creates a hash table with two keys: B'NumberCoefficients and
B'SectionString. The first key is a list of numbers in CC that are
coefficients, and the second key is a string representing the linear
polynomial. The option RandomCoefficientGenerator can be set to a function to
generate random numbers for the coefficients.

To get affine linear equations include 1 in the input list.

To have an affine linear equation that contains a particular point we set the
ContainsPoint option to a list of coordinates or a point. To get an homogeneous
equation that contains a projective point we have to set the ContainsPoint
option as well as the B'Homogenization option.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : s=makeB'Section({x,y,z})                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = B'Section{...2...}                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : B'Section                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : class s                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = B'Section                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Type                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : randomRealCoefficientGenerator=()->random(RR)                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = randomRealCoefficientGenerator                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : FunctionClosure                                                         |
